## IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS

### For ALL three servers:

1. Use @modelcontextprotocol/sdk to create the server
1. Use StdioServerTransport for transport
1. Wrap every tool handler in try/catch
1. Log to stderr (never stdout — stdout is the MCP protocol channel)
1. Validate all inputs before executing
1. For shell commands, always sanitize inputs to prevent injection

### package.json for each server must include:

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc",
    "start": "node dist/index.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk": "latest"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "typescript": "^5.0.0",
    "@types/node": "^18.0.0"
  }
}
```

